:: Lake House Upgrades
<<effects>>
You sit at the desk, and look through the ways the lakehouse could be improved.
<br><br>

<<lakehouse_upgrades_current>>
<<lakehouse_upgrades_status>>

<<if _upgrade_count gte 5>>
	<<earnFeat "The Fortress">>
<</if>>

<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Lake House Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Lake House Upgrades Wall 1
<<effects>>

The surrounding forest is untamed and the ground is unstable. Foundations are required to build anything.
<br><br>

<span class="gold">Costs £5000.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">Will take a week to build.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">There'll be workers on the lake house until the project is completed.</span>
<br>
<br>

<<if $lakehouse.build>>
	<span class="blue">Only one upgrade can be worked on at once.</span>
	<br>
<<elseif $money gte 500000>>
	<<link [[Build (0:20)|Lake House Upgrades Build]]>><<pass 20>><<set $money -= 500000>><<set $lakehouse.build to "wall 1">><<set $lakehouse.build_timer to 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Back|Lake House Upgrades]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Lake House Upgrades Build
<<effects>>

You make the call. They'll start work at once.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Lake House Upgrades]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Lake House Upgrades Wall 2
<<effects>>

A metal fence could be built atop the stone perimeter. It would take more effort to climb.
<br><br>

<span class="green">Thwarts some intrusion attempts.</span>
<br>
<span class="green">Slows attackers during an assault.</span>
<br>
<span class="gold">Costs £20000.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">Will take two weeks to build.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">There'll be workers on the lake house until the project is completed.</span>
<br>
<br>

<<if $lakehouse.build>>
	<span class="blue">Only one upgrade can be worked on at once.</span>
	<br>
<<elseif $money gte 2000000>>
	<<link [[Build (0:20)|Lake House Upgrades Build]]>><<pass 20>><<set $money -= 2000000>><<set $lakehouse.build to "wall 2">><<set $lakehouse.build_timer to 14>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Back|Lake House Upgrades]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Lake House Upgrades Wall 3
<<effects>>

The fence could be crowned with barbed wire, making it impossible to climb without special equipment.
<br><br>
<span class="green">Thwarts many intrusion attempts.</span>
<br>
<span class="green">Further slows attackers during an assault.</span>
<br>
<span class="gold">Costs £5000.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">Will take a week to build.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">There'll be workers on the lake house until the project is completed.</span>
<br>
<br>

<<if $lakehouse.build>>
	<span class="blue">Only one upgrade can be worked on at once.</span>
	<br>
