	<<link [[Build (0:20)|Lake House Upgrades Build]]>><<pass 20>><<set $money -= 500000>><<set $lakehouse.build to "wall 3">><<set $lakehouse.build_timer to 7>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Back|Lake House Upgrades]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Lake House Upgrades Tower
<<effects>>


A tower could be built to watch over the lake house at night. You'll need to employ someone to staff it.
<br><br>

<span class="green">Gives information during assaults.</span>
<br>
<span class="purple">Needs to be staffed to fully function.</span>
<br>
<span class="gold">Costs £20000.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">Will take two weeks to build.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">There'll be workers on the lake house until the project is completed.</span>
<br>
<br>

<<if $lakehouse.build>>
	<span class="blue">Only one upgrade can be worked on at once.</span>
	<br>
<<elseif $money gte 2000000>>
	<<link [[Build (0:20)|Lake House Upgrades Build]]>><<pass 20>><<set $money -= 2000000>><<set $lakehouse.build to "tower 1">><<set $lakehouse.build_timer to 14>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Back|Lake House Upgrades]]>><</link>>
<br>

