:: Lake House Upgrades Guard Post
<<effects>>

A guard post could be built to house a guard. You'll need to employ someone to staff it.
<br><br>

<span class="green">Fights anyone that gets through the defenses.</span>
<br>
<span class="purple">Only functions while staffed.</span>
<br>
<span class="gold">Costs £10000.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">Will take a week to build.</span>
<br>
<span class="blue">There'll be workers on the lake house until the project is completed.</span>
